/self-test/

# web/public/ is generated by web/tools/gen-rules.mjs, and the Dockerfile
# deletes and regenerates it on every build. Committing it would let the
# checked-in HTML drift away from formatter/rules/rules.yaml and
# web/content/rules/ with no test noticing. Regenerate with:
#   node web/tools/gen-rules.mjs
/web/public/
